    ``where``. ``where`` can either have same dimension as input.

    >>> where=jnp.array([[1, 0, 1, 0],
    ...                  [0, 0, 1, 1],
    ...                  [1, 1, 1, 0]], dtype=bool)
    >>> jnp.min(x, axis=1, keepdims=True, initial=0, where=where)
    Array([[ 0],
           [-2],
           [-4]], dtype=int32)

